# The repository is a Go project that also happens to be a VS Code extension, so
# this says what goes into the package rather than what stays out of it: everything
# is left out, and the few files the extension is made of are let back in. A list
# the other way round would have to be kept up with every directory ever added.
**

!package.json
!README.md
!LICENSE
!icon.png
!extension/out/**/*.js
!extension/media/**
# The binary a released build ships, put here by the release workflow. A build from
# a checkout has no bin/ and packages without one.
!bin/**
